OL,3,GNEWSAThree train stations set for huge
OL,4,Arevamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree train stations across the West of
OL,7,FEngland are set to undergo
OL,8,Fmulti-million-pound revamps.
OL,10,FCastle Cary, Weston-super-Mare and
OL,11,FCheltenham stations are to get a share
OL,12,Fof #24m of investment in accessibility
OL,13,Fmeasures including new lifts, bridges
OL,14,Fand ramps.
OL,16,FJane Wickenden, a wheelchair user, said
OL,17,Fit will make a big difference to her
OL,18,Flife as when there are no staff working
OL,19,Fat Castle Cary in Somerset in the
OL,20,Fevening, she has to use another station
OL,21,Fand then pay for a taxi back to her
OL,22,Fcar.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
